  · exact exact_l2 1 k n ⟨(k - 1) / 2, by omega⟩ (by omega) (by omega)
  · exact exact_l7 k n ⟨k / 2, by omega⟩ (by omega) (by omega)
  · exact exact_l0 2 k n (by norm_num) ⟨(k - 1) / 2, by omega⟩ (by omega) (by omega)
